     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Audiovisual resources",
     "texto": [
      "**Lydspor** is the soundtrack and **klipping** is the editing. **Et nærbilde** shows a person or object up close.",
      "A **filmatisering** adapts a work to the screen; the result can change the emphasis or the order of the story."
     ],
